             </h4>
             <ul className="text-sm text-amber-800 space-y-2 list-disc ml-6 font-medium">
                <li><b>Mixed Content:</b> If your URL is <code>http://</code>, browsers will block it on secure sites. Ensure your endpoint is <b>HTTPS</b>.</li>
                <li><b>CORS:</b> Your server <i>must</i> allow <b>cross-origin</b> requests. In Python, add CORSMiddleware. In Google Scripts, this is handled automatically if deployed correctly.</li>
                <li><b>Google Apps Script:</b> You MUST deploy as <b>Web App</b> with <i>"Who has access"</i> set to <b>"Anyone"</b>.</li>
             </ul>
          </div>

          <div className="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
            <div className="bg-white p-10 rounded-[48px] shadow-sm border border-slate-100">
                 <h3 className="text-2xl font-black mb-6">Endpoint Settings</h3>
                 <form onSubmit={handleUpdateUrl} className="space-y-6">
